\(P\) & \(\frac{1}{27}\) & \(\frac{14}{27}\) & \(\frac{4}{9}\)
\end{tabular}
\end{center}

因此 \(E(\xi)=1\cdot\frac{1}{27}+2\cdot\frac{14}{27}+3\cdot\frac{4}{9}=\frac{65}{27}\).
