•\[f'(x)=\frac1x-2ax=\frac{1-2ax^2}{x}\]因\(x&gt;0\)，所以当\(0&lt;x&lt;1/\sqrt{2a}\)时\(f'(x)&gt;0\)，当\(x&gt;1/\sqrt{2a}\)时\(f'(x)&lt;0\). 因此\(f(x)\)在\[\left(0,\frac1{\sqrt{2a}}\right)\]上单调递增，在\[\left(\frac1{\sqrt{2a}},+\infty\right)\]上单调递减.

• 当\(a=1/8\)时，令\[g(x)=f(x)-f\left(\frac32\right)
=\ln x-\frac{x^2}{8}-\ln\frac32+\frac9{32}\]函数\(g\)在\([2,4]\)上连续. 对\(u&gt;0\)，由\[\frac{u}{1+u}&lt;\ln(1+u)&lt;u\]可得\[g(2)=\ln\frac43-\frac7{32}
&gt;\frac14-\frac7{32}
=\frac1{32}&gt;0\]以及\[g(4)=\ln\frac83-\frac{55}{32}
&lt;\frac53-\frac{55}{32}
=-\frac5{96}&lt;0\]由零点定理，存在\(x_0\in(2,4)\subset(2,+\infty)\)，使\(g(x_0)=0\)，即\(f(x_0)=f\left(\frac32\right)\).

• 由\(\beta-\alpha\geqslant1\)知\(\alpha&lt;\beta\). 令\(d=\beta-\alpha\)，\(1\leqslant d\leqslant2\)，\(1\leqslant\alpha\leqslant3-d\).
由\(f(\alpha)=f(\beta)\)，得\[a=\frac{\ln(\beta/\alpha)}{\beta^2-\alpha^2}
=\frac{\ln(1+d/\alpha)}{d(2\alpha+d)}\]先证上界. 因\(\alpha\geqslant1\)且\(1\leqslant d\leqslant2\)，有\(1+d/\alpha\leqslant1+d\). 又令\(h(d)=2^d-d-1\)，则\(h(1)=0\)，且\(h'(d)=2^d\ln2-1\geqslant2\ln2-1&gt;0\)，所以\(1+d\leqslant2^d\). 因而\[\ln(1+d/\alpha)\leqslant d\ln2\]又\(2\alpha+d=\alpha+\beta\geqslant3\)，所以\[a\leqslant\frac{d\ln2}{3d}=\frac{\ln2}{3}\]再证下界. 对固定的\(d\)，分子\(\ln(1+d/\alpha)\)随\(\alpha\)增大而减小，分母\(d(2\alpha+d)\)随\(\alpha\)增大而增大，故该比值随\(\alpha\)减小. 由\(\alpha\leqslant3-d\)，\[a\geqslant
\frac{\ln\left(1+\frac{d}{3-d}\right)}{d(6-d)}
=:G(d)\]令\(u=d/(3-d)\)，则\(u\in[1/2,2]\)，且\[G(d)=\frac{\ln(1+u)}{d(6-d)}\]直接求导得\[G'(d)=
\frac{\dfrac{d(6-d)}{3-d}-2(3-d)\ln(1+u)}{[d(6-d)]^2}
=\frac{3\left[u(2+u)-2\ln(1+u)\right]}{(1+u)[d(6-d)]^2}\]由于\(\ln(1+u)&lt;u\)，有\[u(2+u)-2\ln(1+u)&gt;u(2+u)-2u=u^2&gt;0\]所以\(G(d)\)在\([1,2]\)上递增，从而\[a\geqslant G(1)
=\frac{\ln\left(\frac32\right)}5
=\frac{\ln3-\ln2}{5}\]综上，\[\frac{\ln3-\ln2}{5}\leqslant a\leqslant\frac{\ln2}{3}\]

